{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"822","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Crossword solving"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Erelong Leha was bored by calculating of the greatest common divisor of two factorials. Therefore he decided to solve some crosswords. It's well known that it is a very interesting occupation though it can be very difficult from time to time. In the course of solving one of the crosswords, Leha had to solve a simple task. You are able to do it too, aren't you?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Leha has two strings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". The hacker wants to change the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" at such way, that it can be found in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" as a substring. All the changes should be the following: Leha chooses one position in the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" and replaces the symbol in this position with the question mark \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". The hacker is sure that the question mark in comparison can play the role of an arbitrary symbol. For example, if he gets string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":"=\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab?b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a result, it will appear in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":"=\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aabrbb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a substring."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Guaranteed that the length of the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" doesn't exceed the length of the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". Help the hacker to replace in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" as few symbols as possible so that the result of the replacements can be found in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" as a substring. The symbol \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" should be considered equal to any other symbol."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ m ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the length of the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the length of the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" correspondingly."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lowercase English letters — string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lowercase English letters — string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line print single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the minimal number of symbols that need to be replaced."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second line print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers denoting the positions of symbols in the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" which need to be replaced. Print the positions in any order. If there are several solutions print any of them. The numbering of the positions begins from one."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 5\nabc\nxaybz\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n2 3 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 10\nabcd\nebceabazcd\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n2 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind"